{"code":"208860","name":"다산디엠씨","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 설립, 2016년 코스닥 상장된 자동차부품 전문기업으로, 중국, 멕시코, 우즈베키스탄, 브라질 등에 글로벌 생산체계를 구축하고 있음. 자동차부품 부문에서 서스펜션, 파워트레인, 조향시스템, 웨더스트립 등을 공급하며, 커넥티드카 솔루션과 전기차충전 플랫폼, AI 탑재 택시 모빌리티 솔루션을 제공하고 있음. 내연기관에서 전기차·수소차 등 미래차 부품으로 사업영역을 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":8620.0,"open":8720.0,"high":11310.0,"low":8460.0,"volume":1949,"amount":16800380.0,"ret_1d":-1.1468,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":33.0626,"ret_5":-3.5794,"ret_20":-33.845,"ret_60":-10.0209,"ret_120":-36.6176,"ret_250":-47.5988,"ma20":10284.0,"ma60":10953.6667,"ma120":10736.3333,"ma200":12325.8,"close_vs_ma200":-30.0654,"close_vs_ma60":-21.3049,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":9.9796,"r2_60":0.0018,"slope_120":-6.9684,"r2_120":0.0045,"slope_250":-39.6177,"r2_250":0.5195,"high52":25200.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":34.2063,"dd_52w":-65.7937,"mdd_1y":-59.2289,"atr14_pct":9.1399,"vol_ann_60":60.9843,"vol_avg20":2213.65,"vol_ratio20":0.8804,"vr5":0.3581,"vr20":0.308,"amount_avg5":15638822.0,"amount_avg20":21931728.5,"amount_avg60":52954177.1667,"obv_chg20":-67.8901,"turnover_20":1.3041,"pv_eff_20":-25.9534,"rsi14":18.4282,"frgn_net_5":-770.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0227,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0227,"frgn_net_20":-2395.0,"inst_net_20":-2.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0705,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0001,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0706,"frgn_net_60":5372.0,"inst_net_60":-2.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1582,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0001,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1582,"frgn_net_120":-91395.0,"inst_net_120":-228.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-2.692,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0067,"smart_net_120_pct":-2.6988,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.94,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":28.0,"op_margin_q":7.6712,"op_qoq":133.3333,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-30.0,"rev_yoy":-5.6848,"op_trend_4q":73.8462,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-4.55,"debt_ratio":77.64,"per":null,"pbr":0.47,"